\* All TLC check configs for AntflyDistributedTransactionRecovery.tla.

==== positive tier=fast
SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    Participants = {p1, p2}
    Coordinator = p1
    MaxEpoch = 2
    MaxRetry = 2
    BuggyCommitWithoutPrepare = FALSE
    BuggyCommitStaleEpoch = FALSE
    BuggyAbortAfterCommit = FALSE
    BuggyPreparedFollowerAbort = FALSE
    BuggyRetryNewTransaction = FALSE
    BuggyCleanupPendingPropagation = FALSE
    BuggyEarlySuccess = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    DecisionNeverReverses
    CommitRequiresAllPrepared
    CommitUsesCurrentTopology
    PreparedFollowerDoesNotPresumeAbort
    StableRetryPreservesIdentityAndWrites
    CleanupRequiresRecoveryComplete
    SuccessReflectsPropagationAndVisibility

==== BadCommitWithoutPrepare
SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    Participants = {p1, p2}
    Coordinator = p1
    MaxEpoch = 2
    MaxRetry = 2
    BuggyCommitWithoutPrepare = TRUE
    BuggyCommitStaleEpoch = FALSE
    BuggyAbortAfterCommit = FALSE
    BuggyPreparedFollowerAbort = FALSE
    BuggyRetryNewTransaction = FALSE
    BuggyCleanupPendingPropagation = FALSE
    BuggyEarlySuccess = FALSE

INVARIANT CommitRequiresAllPrepared

